      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Thanks to @elonmusk & @SpaceX, the City of Memphis finished its Fiscal Year ahead of budget for the first time in a long time. \n\nThe City is tracking roughly $5.6 million ahead for the current year. \n\nMemphis Mayor Paul Young said this week that SpaceX generated $54 million in taxes for the City and County this year.",
      "quote": null,
